ORIGIN

This skill is original work. It codifies a packaging pipeline developed while preparing
six skills for publication on lawve.ai: a gate for suitability, a provenance and licence
step, a set of standard compliance transforms, programmatic validation, and form-entry
generation. The requirements it encodes were gathered from lawve.ai's submission form and
the lawve-ai/awesome-legal-skills contribution guidelines as of July 2026, and are
recorded as a dated snapshot in resources/requirements.md.

Lawve-Prep is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, Lawve.

---

BUNDLED CODE

One Python script is included, scripts/validate.py. It targets Python 3 and imports only
from the standard library (os, re, sys). It is read-only: it reads the skill folder it is
pointed at, writes nothing, makes no network calls, spawns no subprocesses, and evaluates
no dynamic code.

